# Build context for the Dockerfile: the workspace manifests, the crates, the
# example config that config.rs embeds and the dashboard app's sources (the
# spa stage builds them). Everything else stays out.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!henk.example.toml
!crates/
!dashboard/
dashboard/node_modules/
dashboard/dist/
crates/*/tests/
**/target/
**/*.db
**/.env*
